msgid "Podcast Analytics for OP3 has been updated to v2.0. Your podcast settings have been migrated automatically, but please verify your Bearer Token in the %s."
msgstr "Podcast Analytics para OP3 se ha actualizado a la v2.0. Tus ajustes de podcast se han migrado automáticamente, pero verifica tu Bearer Token en %s."

